1
00:00:03,966 --> 00:00:04,300
Dad!

2
00:00:05,033 --> 00:00:05,733
Why are you pushing me?

3
00:00:06,066 --> 00:00:06,900
The loan is due.

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,900
Stay here a few days, ask the GM for an extension.

5
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,166
Just stay here for a few days, okay?

6
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,133
Help us out just this once.

7
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:19,600
You owe the money! Why pawn me off to pay your debt?

8
00:00:19,933 --> 00:00:22,833
Behave at the Ratchawong house. Don't get kicked out right away.

9
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:28,800
Dad, Mom, don't leave!

10
00:00:30,233 --> 00:00:31,733
At least look back at me!

11
00:00:32,433 --> 00:00:33,200
Some parents they are.

12
00:00:33,266 --> 00:00:34,566
Giving away their son with free shipping.

13
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:36,866
At least leave a return address!

14
00:00:37,733 --> 00:00:41,300
Mr. Nawin, here's your card. You can access the guest room and gardens.

15
00:00:42,633 --> 00:00:43,533
What about the front gate?

16
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:44,466
Can I leave?

17
00:00:45,066 --> 00:00:48,200
That needs Mr. Thanat's approval. I can't make that call.

18
00:00:49,133 --> 00:00:50,400
Room and board included, freedom not.

19
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:53,200
I'm here for a few days, not years!

20
00:00:53,433 --> 00:00:55,733
Then call whoever can open it. I'll ask him myself.

21
00:01:00,633 --> 00:01:04,066
Sir agreed to let you stay. The loan must be discussed in person, but he's still busy.

22
00:01:04,466 --> 00:01:08,500
The west pavilion is Sir's private residence. Do not barge in uninvited.

23
00:01:13,366 --> 00:01:15,533
He won't even see me, but he's already bossing me around.

24
00:01:15,966 --> 00:01:17,300
Play nice and suck up to the Ratchawongs?

25
00:01:17,966 --> 00:01:18,566
Like hell I will.

26
00:01:19,133 --> 00:01:20,666
The more they forbid it, the more I want to push it.

27
00:01:20,833 --> 00:01:21,833
What if things get out of hand?

28
00:01:22,366 --> 00:01:24,000
Who cares? I need to blow off steam first.
